  "label": "The Black Ranger is mapped to the Black man",
  "description": "The text 'the black ranger' in the top panel is mapped onto the visual entity 'Black_man' in the middle panel. The meme uses the Black man's image to represent the Black Ranger, creating a false equivalence that implies the Black Ranger's costume is being compared to the ape-like figure, thereby dehumanizing Black people. The text 'your argument it's completely valid!' further reinforces this by falsely validating the racist comparison.",
